WEBVTT

00:00:02.581 --> 00:00:06.864
A group world class now waits for its session on World loading, then starts with

00:00:06.864 --> 00:00:07.646
everyone.

00:00:10.324 --> 00:00:15.020
The card names the group, counts down to the start each second, and keeps the action

00:00:15.020 --> 00:00:16.159
off until then.

00:00:23.228 --> 00:00:27.844
At the session's start the class ride opens for everyone, on the panorama if the

00:00:27.844 --> 00:00:29.183
world isn't ready.

00:00:36.133 --> 00:00:40.891
The world keeps loading behind the ride and fades in when it is ready; the clock and

00:00:40.891 --> 00:00:42.210
the bike carry on.

00:00:49.038 --> 00:00:53.528
With no bike at the start, the class still starts, with the lost-bike alert and the

00:00:53.528 --> 00:00:54.802
group's own words.

00:01:01.942 --> 00:01:04.563
The countdown, from a phone to the full screen.

00:01:14.847 --> 00:01:19.386
What the tests prove: the countdown, the start with everyone, the late fade, and the

00:01:19.386 --> 00:01:20.389
missing bike.

00:01:25.170 --> 00:01:29.774
Telo Ride, from the Telo family, turns a smart bike at home into a game.

00:01:30.119 --> 00:01:34.631
It pairs with the bike over Bluetooth, reads your power and sets resistance for

00:01:34.631 --> 00:01:36.302
every hill and interval.

00:01:36.647 --> 00:01:41.825
Two doors: Race (ride a map against your best-time ghost, bots or people) and

00:01:41.825 --> 00:01:47.273
Classes (ride along to a video, alone or with a group), fed by one progression of

00:01:47.273 --> 00:01:50.263
XP, rider levels, stars and map unlocks.

00:01:50.608 --> 00:01:53.101
A custom workout lives under Profile.
